# NOVA CRYPTO: SECP256K1 ELLIPTIC CURVE ARITHMETIC
# Module: std/crypto/ecc_secp256k1.nv
# Jacobian Point Doubling & Addition for Bitcoin / Ethereum
# 100% Pure Nova Native - Zero C / Zero LLVM Dependencies
